<body>
  <a class="skip-link" href="#assessment-decision">Skip to assessment</a>
  <div class="report-shell">
    <main class="report-content" id="assessment-document">
      <header class="assessment-masthead"><div class="masthead-brand"><span class="wordmark">MCPVal</span><span class="report-kind">Server assessment</span></div>
        <h1 class="target-identity">snapshot.example.test</h1>
        <p class="target-endpoint">https://snapshot.example.test/mcp</p>
        <p class="report-metadata">Recorded run: 2026-04-20 10:00:12 UTC · Profile: provider · Full detail</p></header>
      <nav class="assessment-contents" aria-label="Contents"><ul>
        <li><a href="#assessment-decision">Decision</a></li><li><a href="#evidence-and-actions">Coverage</a></li><li><a href="#priority-actions">Actions</a></li>
        <li><a href="#technical-evidence">Evidence</a></li><li><a href="#method-and-provenance">Provenance</a></li><li><a href="#recorded-claims">Claims appendix</a></li></ul></nav>
      <section class="decision-panel" id="assessment-decision" aria-labelledby="assessment-decision-title">
        <div class="decision-grid"><div class="decision-narrative"><p class="section-kicker">Assessment decision</p>
        <h2 id="assessment-decision-title">Core protocol requirements not met</h2>
        <p class="decision-reason">Server ignored the requested MCP protocol version.</p>
        <p class="scope-limit"><strong>Scope limit:</strong> prompt-surface / prompts/list: Skipped. Server does not advertise prompts capability.</p>
        </div><dl class="assessment-facts decision-facts">
          <div><dt><span>Execution</span></dt><dd>Completed</dd></div>
          <div><dt><span>Assurance</span></dt><dd>Core: Nonconformant; security: Issues Found; operations: Ready</dd></div>
          <div><dt><span>Policy disposition</span></dt><dd>Failed</dd></div>
          <div><dt><span>Certificate</span></dt><dd>Eligibility: Ineligible; issuance is not established by this report</dd></div>
        </dl></div><dl class="assessment-facts decision-context">
          <div><dt><span>Profile and revision</span></dt><dd>provider / 2026-11-05.1</dd></div>
          <div><dt><span>Execution scope</span></dt><dd>Safe</dd></div>
          <div><dt><span>Transport</span></dt><dd>http</dd></div>
          <div><dt><span>Negotiated protocol</span></dt><dd>2025-11-25</dd></div>
          <div><dt><span>Recommended exit</span></dt><dd>1</dd></div>
        </dl>
        <a class="decision-forward" href="#priority-actions">Review the priority actions</a>
      </section>

<div class="supporting-cards">
<section class="support-card" aria-labelledby="agent-capability-title"><h2 id="agent-capability-title">Agent capability and execution</h2><dl class="agent-facts">
<div><dt>Advertised</dt><dd>Unavailable: capability advertisement was not recorded.</dd></div>
<div><dt>Permitted</dt><dd>Safe mode: discovery and static analysis only.</dd></div>
<div><dt>Observed</dt><dd>Runtime evidence unavailable; discovery alone does not establish execution.</dd></div>
</dl><p class="catalog-summary">Recorded catalog — Tools: 2; Resources: 1; Prompts: unavailable.</p><a href="#technical-evidence">Explore capability evidence</a></section>
<section class="support-card next-action-card" aria-labelledby="next-action-title"><div class="support-card-heading"><h2 id="next-action-title">Next priority action</h2>
<span class="tone-chip tone-neutral">Priority 1</span></div>
<h3 class="next-action-summary">Echo the negotiated protocol version in initialize.result.</h3><p class="action-component"><strong>Component:</strong> <code>Initialization</code></p>
<p class="action-impact"><strong>Why it matters:</strong> Establish trustworthy protocol and execution evidence before interpreting dependent results.</p><p class="action-kind">Remediation</p>
<a class="next-action-link" href="#action-bc96e00c6dddc2f43706c99ffd6c7aee61544157fd04d7073d948a28f4545508">Review action and evidence</a></section>
</div>

      <section class="assessment-section" id="evidence-and-actions" aria-labelledby="evidence-and-actions-title">
        <h2 id="evidence-and-actions-title">Coverage</h2>
